Note on third-party material:

- `test/dictionary-test-vectors.json` is the shared behavioural-contract file
  from per-simmons/murmur-youtube (https://github.com/per-simmons/murmur-youtube),
  included here because the correction semantics are contractually shared
  across implementations. That upstream repository carries no license file.
- The Parakeet ONNX speech model used by the Windows companion app is NVIDIA
  Parakeet TDT 0.6B (CC-BY-4.0, modified by int8 quantization and ONNX export),
  run via sherpa-onnx (Apache-2.0). See README.md.
